<section id="S3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.3 </span>Robotic Policy Learning with Synthetic Data</h3>

<div id="S3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We validate our world model’s utility by generating synthetic robotic video data for downstream policy learning based on Diffusion Policy (DP) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib29" title="" class="ltx_ref">29</a>]</cite> and <math id="S3.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi</annotation></semantics></math>0 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib30" title="" class="ltx_ref">30</a>]</cite>. Through controlled experiments with progressively adding synthetic data, we systematically measure the impact of generated data on policy learning performance. The results are shown in Table <a href="#S3.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 3.3 Robotic Policy Learning with Synthetic Data ‣ 3 Experiments ‣ RoboScape: Physics-informed Embodied World Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Results of policy learning with DP on Robomimic task and <math id="S3.T3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi</annotation></semantics></math>0 on LIBERO tasks.</figcaption>
<div id="S3.T3.6" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:67.8pt;vertical-align:-32.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-46.2pt,9.1pt) scale(0.788722037289138,0.788722037289138) ;">
<table id="S3.T3.6.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S3.T3.6.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T3.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t" colspan="2"><span id="S3.T3.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">DP on Robomimic tasks</span></th>
<th id="S3.T3.6.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_column"></th>
<th id="S3.T3.6.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t" colspan="6"><math id="S3.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">π</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S3.T3.6.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0 on LIBERO tasks</span></th></tr>
<tr id="S3.T3.6.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
