</section>
<section id="A4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.3 </span>Robotic Policy Evaluation (add visualization results of our model and baselines</h3>

<div id="A4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this part, we provide visualization results of RoboScape and other baselines in policy evaluation. The failure cases are presented in Figure <a href="#A4.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ D.3 Robotic Policy Evaluation (add visualization results of our model and baselines ‣ Appendix D More Visualization Results ‣ RoboScape: Physics-informed Embodied World Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> while the successful cases are shown in Figure <a href="#A4.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ D.3 Robotic Policy Evaluation (add visualization results of our model and baselines ‣ Appendix D More Visualization Results ‣ RoboScape: Physics-informed Embodied World Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2506.23135v1/Sup_PE_failure.png" id="A4.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/222;" width="476" height="222" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A4.F11.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 11</span>: </span><span id="A4.F11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Supplemented visualization results of failure cases in policy evaluation. </span></figcaption>
</figure>
