<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A4.F12.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 12</span>: </span><span id="A4.F12.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Supplemented visualization results of successful cases in policy evaluation. </span></figcaption>
